###
### Game data is stored at %SystemDrive%\Users\%USERNAME%\AppData\Roaming\Steam\CODEX\376870
###

[Settings]
###
### Game identifier (http://store.steampowered.com/app/376870)
###
AppId=376870
###
### Steam Account ID, set it to 0 to get a random Account ID
###
#AccountId=0
### 
### Name of the current player
###
UserName=Player
###
### Language that will be used in the game
###
Language=english
###
### Enable lobby mode
###
LobbyEnabled=1
###
### Lobby port to listen on
###
#LobbyPort=31183
###
### Enable/Disable Steam overlay
###
Overlays=1
###
### Set Steam connection to offline mode
###
Offline=0
###

[Interfaces]
###
### Steam Client API interface versions
###
SteamApps=STEAMAPPS_INTERFACE_VERSION005
SteamClient=SteamClient012
SteamContentServer=SteamContentServer002
SteamFriends=SteamFriends011
SteamGameServer=SteamGameServer011
SteamGameServerStats=SteamGameServerStats001
SteamHTTP=STEAMHTTP_INTERFACE_VERSION001
SteamMatchMaking=SteamMatchMaking009
